		(property "Note" "NFC tuning, MEASURED not assumed: ce-rf gives the 2-turn coil L = 0.2449 uH and C_external = 554.6 pF across it, so each series capacitor is 1.109 nF. The two must be MATCHED to each other - a mismatch unbalances the tag antenna. OPEN: a 1.1 nF C0G in 0201 has NOT been confirmed to exist at LCSC, and an X7R here would drift the tuning with temperature. If only 1.0 nF C0G is buyable the tank lands 5.3 % high (14.28 MHz) and needs a bench trim."
